Solution: Exploring the functionality of the website, we find we are able to view posts and leave comments (`comment`, `name`, `email`, `website`).

Opening DevTools (F12) on the main page and searching for `"hashchange"` in the inspector identifies the following script.
```js
$(window).on('hashchange', function(){
	var post = $('section.blog-list h2:contains(' + decodeURIComponent(window.location.hash.slice(1)) + ')');
	if (post) post.get(0).scrollIntoView();
});
```

